    <briefdescription>
<para>Implementation of <ref refid="structllvm_1_1format__provider" kindref="compound">format_provider&lt;T&gt;</ref> for integral arithmetic types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The options string of an integral type has the grammar:</para>
<para>integer_options :: [style][digits] style ::  digits :: &lt;non-negative integer&gt; 0-99</para>
<para><hruler/>
 </para>
